<title>USA: Union Texas Petroleum sets buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Union Texas Petroleum sets buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Texas Petroleum Holdings Inc said on Friday its board authorized the buyback of up to two million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The buyback program is in addition to a stock buyback program started in 1994.  Under that program, there are 398,764 shares remaining to be repurchased.</p>
</text>
